ral Plateau groups including Yakima, Spokan, Cayuse, Nez Percé, Kootenai, and Salish (Flathead).  Includes images of babies in cradleboards, a mother breast feeding a baby outdoors, and family groups. Sitters include Annie Kash Kash, Curly Jim, Minnie Krailey, Antoine, and Joseph Cregg.","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:- Portraits of Native Americans from the Plateau region.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"ugl4pp","at":1785794992490},"key":"- Portraits of Native Americans from the Plateau region.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,8],"size":606,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
